      "created_at": "2026-01-14T11:05:07.253Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/ismail_tabtabai\">@Ismail_Tabtabai</a></p>\n<p>it is dynamic and can be set as following;</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/d/2/d2f26c64746af9a51e38c418d188f54de31fa6f7.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/d2f26c64746af9a51e38c418d188f54de31fa6f7\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/2/d2f26c64746af9a51e38c418d188f54de31fa6f7_2_690x319.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"u67EPsWj2WIY7sDkheMpskFu3pZ\" width=\"690\" height=\"319\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/2/d2f26c64746af9a51e38c418d188f54de31fa6f7_2_690x319.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/2/d2f26c64746af9a51e38c418d188f54de31fa6f7_2_1035x478.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/2/d2f26c64746af9a51e38c418d188f54de31fa6f7_2_1380x638.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FCFBF9\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1919×888 51.4 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
